  - without cat **.77182**; with cat **.77202** (+0.0002 pair -> ~+0.0001 joint). Below the +.001-joint bar; **do not add**.
- v4 remains the best add-on found (+~.0015 pair in my framework, ~+.0005 joint); still below rigel's bar, optional only.

